        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Shows: Minute to Win It\n- People: Guy Fieri, Apolo Ohno\n- Companies: NBC, Game Show Network (GSN)\n- Sports: Short track speed skating, Winter Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- Minute to Win It originally aired on NBC with Guy Fieri as host.\n- Minute to Win It was revived in 2013 on Game Show Network (GSN) with Apolo Ohno presenting the show.\n- Apolo Anton Ohno was born on May 22, 1982.\n- Apolo Anton Ohno is a retired American short track speed skating competitor.\n- Apolo Anton Ohno won eight Winter Olympics medals: two gold, two silver, and four bronze.",
